<view class="screen login-screen">
  <view class="welcome-mark">⌂</view>
  <view class="eyebrow">邻里生活 · RESIDENT</view>
  <view class="welcome-title">让家的每一天<view>都更方便一点。</view></view>
  <view class="subtitle">连接社区，开启你的专属生活服务。</view>
  <view class="card login-card"><view class="section-title">欢迎回家</view><view class="muted">使用微信登录后，即可认领房屋、查看审核进度。手机号在需要时由你主动授权。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录</button>
    <view class="hint">微信身份用于创建平台账号，房屋权限由物业审核。</view>
  </view>
</view>
